## Third-party notices

This project ports and adapts the artifact scoring algorithm and attribute
weight tables from **miao-plugin**, which is distributed under the MIT License:

    miao-plugin — https://github.com/yoimiya-kokomi/miao-plugin
    Copyright (c) Yoimiya-Kokomi
    Licensed under the MIT License.

Specifically derived from that project:

- `models/artis/ArtisMark.js`      → `service/hsr/core/artifact_mark.py`
- `models/artis/ArtisMarkCfg.js`   → `service/hsr/core/artifact_mark_cfg.py`
- `resources/meta-sr/artifact/artis-mark.js` → `service/hsr/data/useful_attr.py`
- `resources/meta-sr/artifact/calc.js`       → `service/hsr/data/sonata_calc.py`

Character, light cone, relic and set metadata is fetched at runtime from
public community APIs and is not redistributed as game assets by this project.

Game data and trademarks belong to miHoYo / HoYoverse. This is an unofficial
fan-made tool with no affiliation to the game's publisher.
